{"seq":4,"slug":"ts-applications","title":"应用场景","docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-analysis/ts-applications","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"anomaly-detection","title":"时间序列异常检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-analysis/ts-applications/anomaly-detection","wordCount":1452,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"changepoint-trend","title":"变点检测与趋势分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-analysis/ts-applications/changepoint-trend","wordCount":1324,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"anomaly-detection-ts","title":"时序异常检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-analysis/ts-applications/anomaly-detection-ts","wordCount":1502,"readingTime":7},{"seq":4,"slug":"financial-ts","title":"金融时间序列","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-analysis/ts-applications/financial-ts","wordCount":1279,"readingTime":6},{"seq":5,"slug":"demand-forecasting","title":"需求预测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-analysis/ts-applications/demand-forecasting","wordCount":1133,"readingTime":5},{"seq":6,"slug":"causal-inference-ts","title":"时间序列因果推断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-analysis/ts-applications/causal-inference-ts","wordCount":1460,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"应用场景-简介\">应用场景 简介</h1><p>本章将时间序列分析的理论和方法落地到三大典型业务领域。不同应用场景的数据特征和业务需求各不相同，需要针对性地选择和调优分析方法。</p>\n<p><strong>金融时间序列</strong>探讨金融数据的时间序列分析方法，包括收益率分析、波动率建模和风险度量等金融领域的特有技术。</p>\n<p><strong>需求预测</strong>讲解电商和零售场景中的需求预测方法，涵盖多层级预测、促销效应建模和新品预测等实用技术。</p>\n<p><strong>时序异常检测</strong>介绍基于时间序列的异常检测方法，探讨如何在系统监控、欺诈检测和质量控制等场景中识别异常模式。</p>\n<p>建议读者根据自身业务领域选择重点学习方向，同时通过跨领域的学习获得方法论的迁移启发。</p>\n"}